# Local coding-agent approvals and transcripts can retain literal credentials.
# Keep these exclusions in the repo so they travel between machines. Do not
# blanket-ignore agent folders: reviewed shared settings/instructions may belong
# in source. Ignore rules do not remove tracked files or erase Git history;
# rotate any exposed credential first, then clean up the affected history.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/projects/
**/.codex/auth.json
**/.codex/sessions/
**/.codex/history.jsonl
**/.gemini/oauth_creds.json
**/.gemini/tmp/
**/.specstory/
.aider.chat.history.md
.aider.input.history

# Local credential bundles and common private SSH keys (not public keys).
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
secrets.local.*
